#: ../../source/docs/common-pocketbeagle-2.rst:7
#: 04088fb6147f48c69eff32a61dcafb8c 2a75c9bf66a44b4d8a15a5d57550184a
#: 9535514dfeef4d47ae0a7742abd21109 dfaab779cb17449baa8cf6b6ec99cf2f
#: e690ed2c460b41dc8eafefe4ae52c33d
msgid ""
"`PocketBeagle 2 <https://www.beagleboard.org/boards/pocketbeagle-2>`__ (PB2)"
" is an upgraded version of the popular PocketBeagle, designed as an ultra-"
"compact, low-cost, and powerful single-board computer (SBC). Targeted at "
"developers, students, and hobbyists, PocketBeagle 2 retains the simplicity "
"and flexibility of its predecessor while delivering enhanced performance and"
" expanded features to support modern development needs. PocketBeagle 2 is "
"ideal for creating IoT devices, robotics projects, and educational "
"applications. Its small form factor and low power consumption make it a "
"versatile platform for embedded development, whether prototyping or "
"deploying at scale."
msgstr ""
"`PocketBeagle 2 <https://www.beagleboard.org/boards/pocketbeagle-2>`__ "
"（PB2）是广受欢迎的 PocketBeagle 的升级版，是一款超紧凑、低成本且性能强劲的单板计算机（SBC）。PocketBeagle 2 "
"面向开发者、学生和爱好者，在保留前代产品简洁与灵活的同时，提供更强的性能和更丰富的功能，以满足现代开发需求。它非常适合用于制作 IoT "
"设备、机器人项目和教育应用。小巧的外形和低功耗使其成为嵌入式开发的多用途平台，无论是原型验证还是规模化部署。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pocketbeagle-2.rst:9
#: 053396fe0282403cbe63bac640577480 1ef90129a10b48b8a69f266f36b66dd4
#: 418445ffdb14406e9b34e2519886c527 59fdb9be96c04dc9821e469a2af5d847
#: a9db38200b3547e99498ae155a90bcf3
msgid ""
"PocketBeagle 2 is based on Texas Instruments AM6254 SoC. Its multiple A53 "
"cores can provide higher performance than the classic PocketBeagle. The new "
"design comes with pre-soldered headers, a 3-pin JST-SH 1.00mm UART debug "
"port, a USB-C port, Texas Instruments MSPM0L1105 Cortex-M0+ MCU for ADC, "
"512MB RAM, and a LiPo Battery charger."
msgstr ""
"PocketBeagle 2 基于 Texas Instruments AM6254 SoC。其多个 A53 核心可提供比经典 PocketBeagle"
" 更高的性能。新设计带有预焊排针、一个 3 针 JST-SH 1.00mm UART 调试口、一个 USB-C 接口、用于 ADC 的 Texas "
"Instruments MSPM0L1105 Cortex-M0+ MCU、512MB RAM 以及一个 LiPo 电池充电器。"

