#: 945cbfde646045e3b43a0637892e35fe
msgid ""
"The SPI BUS initialisation is the only main issue related to Ardupilot. We "
"recommend to freeze (not update) the linux kernel. Beside all working and "
"support from Mr, RobertCNelson, we noted sometimes a new kernel can add "
"problems with the SPI bus. This can be noticed when you run ardupilot and "
"receive messages of the IMU RESET in the GCS messages panel."
msgstr ""
"SPI 总线初始化是与 Ardupilot 相关的唯一主要问题。我们建议冻结（不更新）Linux 内核。尽管 RobertCNelson "
"先生提供了支持且一切都能工作，但我们注意到有时新内核会给 SPI 总线带来问题。当你运行 ardupilot 并在 GCS 消息面板中收到 IMU "
"RESET 消息时即可发现此问题。"

